{"3334640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Time Jump", "steam_appid": 3334640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Solo devved Action-Adventure Through History!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >William thinks his time-travel adventure happened by accident.<br>It didn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/7fa84094170d7064f9219730e8a2afc6.poster.avif?t=1788066227\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/7fa84094170d7064f9219730e8a2afc6.webm?t=1788066227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/7fa84094170d7064f9219730e8a2afc6.mp4?t=1788066227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS RELATIVE, OKAY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through 5 periods, each one a uniquely different set of rules.<br>Explore. Survive. Investigate. Liberate. Prevent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/3c1c07af139549f7821e8709d42ba084.poster.avif?t=1788066227\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/3c1c07af139549f7821e8709d42ba084.webm?t=1788066227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/3c1c07af139549f7821e8709d42ba084.mp4?t=1788066227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE CHARGE. ONE JUMP.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cimera needs power.<br>Can your camera jump before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/d59fac65ebb08571902bafa1bec841b1.poster.avif?t=1788066227\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/d59fac65ebb08571902bafa1bec841b1.webm?t=1788066227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/d59fac65ebb08571902bafa1bec841b1.mp4?t=1788066227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME FOR T.E.A.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yourself, evil or not. Your choice.<br>Attack or Talk. Just watch out for those Cyborg units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/ae1385dd932c995d8729cc82ce42da6a.avif?t=1788066227\" width=1480 height=784 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCIDENTAL FRIENDSHIPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sherrif, a hairdresser, or yourself. You just never know. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/1434ff826faaa7d57b63ffc34e187eb0.avif?t=1788066227\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras_big/1434ff826faaa7d57b63ffc34e187eb0.webp?t=1788066227 width=1560 height=634 /></span><